title: "EU AI Act dataset"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
authors:
  - name: "SimpleAct UG (haftungsbeschränkt)"
    website: "https://simpleact.de"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SimpleAct-Compliance/eu-ai-act-dataset"
url: "https://simpleact.eu/ai-act"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: "Obligations, application dates, Annex III use cases, prohibited practices and fines of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 (AI Act) as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744 (Digital Omnibus on AI), as structured data in JSON, YAML and iCalendar, in English and German."
keywords:
  - EU AI Act
  - AI Act
  - KI-Verordnung
  - Digital Omnibus
  - Annex III
  - high-risk AI
  - AI governance
  - compliance
  - dataset
